# The shipped ticket prompts are byte-compared raw (default-prompts.spec.ts):
# LF, newline-terminated. GitHub's Windows runners default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which would check the LF blobs out as CRLF and fail
# CI while local worktrees (never re-checked out) stay green. eol=lf
# overrides autocrlf at checkout.
plugins/tickets/prompts/*.md text eol=lf
